              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The walls of the main room and of the inner room were all decorated with carved figures of winged creatures, palm trees, and flowers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
