          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The doors were decorated with carved figures of winged creatures, palm trees, and flowers. The doors, the winged creatures, and the palm trees were covered with gold. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
